    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't even know what to do anymore. everything i worked for so hard for... it's just gone. the internship fell through and i know my parents are going to see me as a total failure. i've always been the one who had it all figured out, the one they could count on. now i'm just... nothing. i can't even look them in the eye. it feels like my whole life is just a lie now.",
